        "en": "Wrestling, horse racing, and archery form the traditional three skills."
      },
      "image": "/static/assets/images/nadamu.jpg",
      "tags": [
        "那达慕",
        "非遗"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ovoo",
      "category": "folk",
      "title": {
        "zh": "祭敖包",
