        "answer": "Naadam is a Mongolian festival centered on wrestling, horse racing, and archery. It is ideal for interactive heritage experiences."
      },
      {
        "keywords": [
          "ovoo",
          "worship"
        ],
        "answer": "Ovoo worship uses offerings such as hada, dairy food, and wine to pray for good weather, safety, and abundance."
      },
      {
        "keywords": [
          "great wall",
          "zhao great wall",
          "gaoque",
          "jilu"
        ],
        "answer": "The Great Wall sites and frontier passes show Yinshan as both a defensive line and a cultural corridor."
      },
      {
        "keywords": [
          "silk road",
